    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="81fd2651-d10d-5dd6-ac53-728cc86eedac" activityNameId="95bf04a5-6157-5390-96b1-bb157d8898f2" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Refinery</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Refinery
The inventory describes the use of materials for the refinery equipment and the land use for a refinery with an annual capacity of 1 million. tonnes crude oil throughput and a life time of 30 years.;
UUID: 6f022bd4-3ef3-3887-b35d-2f37f1da5844
Infrastructure for chemical processing and land use. No data for construction, storage facilities and office buildings.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Data for a distillation unit have been estimated to assess the use of materials.
Time period: Time of publications and information in the literature
Production volume: 676 million tonnes crude oil for 2016 in 90 refineries in RER
Sampling: Literature survey and plant data. 
Extrapolations: From single plant parts to whole refinery.
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_6f022bd4-3ef3-3887-b35d-2f37f1da5844.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
